  "prefLabel": "Diet 401.01 Activity",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Diet 401.01 “Activity” means a program, a presentation, a course of study or independent self-study, an examination, reading or writing of peer-reviewed professional publications relating to the field of dietetics, a seminar, or a meeting, that is attended, taken, undertaken, or presented by a person in fulfillment of the continuing professional education credit requirement set forth in these rules.\n\nSource. #7938, eff 8-23-03; ss by #8336, eff 5-1-05, EXPIRED: 5-1-13\n\nNew. #10691, eff 10-9-14; ss by #14314, eff 9-9-25, EXPIRES: 9-9-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/diet100-500.html"
